# Owner-assisted discovery output (DESIGN.md §6.1). A successful run writes the
# provider's complete unsanitized tool surface here — descriptions, schemas,
# annotations. It is reviewed by a human and folded into a manifest by hand;
# the raw dump is never committed.
candidate.json
candidate*.json
review-checklist.txt
dist/

# Local agent/editor settings. The released v0.1.0 sdist shipped
# `.claude/settings.local.json` because the release was cut from a working tree
# where this line did not exist. Ignoring it is the smaller half of the fix —
# the real one is the sdist allowlist in `pyproject.toml` and
# `scripts/check_sdist.py`, which refuse an unexpected path whether or not
# anyone remembered to ignore it.
.claude/
